    <decisions>
        <name>Has_Email</name>
        <label>Has Email?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Yes_Has_Email</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Contact.Email</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Send_Confirmation_Email</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Yes — Has Email</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Is_Scheduled_With_Contact</name>
        <label>Is Scheduled With Contact?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Yes_Scheduled_And_Has_Contact</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_TestDrive.AF_Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Scheduled</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_TestDrive.AF_Contact__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Contact</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Yes — Scheduled And Has Contact</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>DEACTIVATED 2026-09-09: superseded by AF_FL_TestDrive_SendConfirmationEmail. Owner decision reversed — gating the customer confirmation email on the owner separately completing the &quot;Complete Test Drive Details&quot; Task added an unnecessary manual step; the email now sends the moment the Test Drive itself becomes fully Scheduled (Status + Vehicle + Vehicle Definition + Time Slot + Location all populated), which already happens in one transaction when the agent picks a slot. Left in place (Obsolete, not deleted) for history. Prior history: Owner decision 2026-08-31 built this Task-triggered mechanism; fix 2026-09-08 (LFRDN-628) removed a hardcoded key-prefix check that broke sandbox portability.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>DateTimeDisplay</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!Get_TestDrive.AF_TestDriveDateTime__c}), &quot;To be confirmed&quot;, TEXT({!Get_TestDrive.AF_TestDriveDateTime__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EmailBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;&lt;html&gt;&lt;body style=&quot;margin:0;padding:16px;background-color:#F4F4F6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E2E5EA;border-top:4px solid #1E7A46;padding:20px 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:3px;background-color:#DFF3E6;color:#1E7A46;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;Confirmed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;color:#0B2545;&quot;&gt;Your Test Drive is Confirmed&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vehicle:&lt;/strong&gt; &apos; &amp; {!VehicleDisplay} &amp; &apos;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/strong&gt; &apos; &amp; {!DateTimeDisplay} &amp; &apos;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &apos; &amp; {!LocationDisplay} &amp; &apos;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;We look forward to seeing you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EmailSubject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Your Test Drive is Confirmed – &quot; &amp; {!Get_TestDrive.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>LocationDisplay</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!Get_TestDrive.AF_Location__c}), &quot;To be confirmed&quot;, {!Get_TestDrive.AF_Location__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>VehicleDisplay</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
    NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_TestDrive.AF_Vehicle__r.Name})),
    {!Get_TestDrive.AF_Vehicle__r.Name},
    IF(
        NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_TestDrive.AF_VehicleDefinition__r.Name})),
        {!Get_TestDrive.AF_VehicleDefinition__r.Name},
        &quot;To be confirmed&quot;
    )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>AF Task Test Drive Confirmation Email {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Task Test Drive Confirmation Email</label>
